wiring_request = "sdk/types/module/module.go — SDK/module-manager owner (domain 15): dispatch the EVM module's streamed chunks through AppModule.InitGenesisStream, close its channel at the final EVM boundary and wait for validation before returning InitGenesis; the current per-chunk InitGenesis calls cannot accept split binding tables."

